!site/src/assets/**/*.png
SWEEP_LENGTH
SWEEP_SLOPE
__pycache__/
PyNEC/
*~
# Emacs auto-save (#file#) and lock (.#file) files
\#*\#
.\#*
TEST_RESULTS
dist/
build/
.coverage
src/antennaknobs/*.c
src/antennaknobs/*.html
*.egg-info/
*.so
.venv/
pg/
node_modules/
src/antennaknobs/web/frontend/dist/
src/antennaknobs/web/frontend/.vite/
# Built frontend bundle: produced by `npm run build` (vite outDir) and bundled
# into the wheel as package data at publish time; never committed to source.
src/antennaknobs/web/static/
# Local Claude Code state stays ignored, but project skills are shared.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
scripts/sterba_center_driven_pattern.png
bench_out/
# Claude Code scratchpad — session-local working files, never shipped
scratchpad/
# Dev-server logs (e.g. `.backend.log` / `.frontend.log` from local runs)
*.log

# PyInstaller freeze environment (ws5 smoke test)
.venv-freeze/

# Session handoff notes, restart prompts and unsent outreach drafts. The
# `.local.md` suffix is the marker and it has always meant "not for the
# repo" — nothing matching it has ever been tracked. Ignored rather than
# merely conventional because a wide `git add` sweeps in whatever is
# untracked, and several of these are drafts addressed to real people.
#
# NOTE this is deliberately narrow. `scratch/` is NOT ignored: it is a
# tracked evidence directory (capture corpora, oracle runs), and hiding it
# would hide study output that belongs in the repo.
*.local.md
